---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Disclaimer from "../components/Disclaimer.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="AI Pre-Mortem Engine — imagine failure before launch">
<h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-boardroom">AI Pre-Mortem Engine</h1>
<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm text-charcoal">Describe a project before launch. Get 10 plausible failure scenarios from a "future investigator" — each with narrative, probability / severity, a real historical precedent, and early-warning signals — plus a probability × severity risk matrix, per-scenario mitigation plans, and a shareable markdown report.</p>
<div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
  <a href="/submit" class="rounded bg-boardroom px-4 py-1.5 font-bold text-white">Run a pre-mortem</a>
  <a href="/history" class="rounded border border-boardroom/40 px-4 py-1.5">History</a>
</div>
<div class="mt-8 rounded border border-boardroom/20 bg-white p-4">
  <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-boardroom">Sample risk matrix — probability × severity</h2>
  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-charcoal/70">Severity on the x-axis (medium → high → critical), probability on the y-axis (low → medium → high). Category colours match the Scenarios page.</p>
  <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-4 gap-1 text-center text-xs">
    <div></div>
    <div class="font-bold text-boardroom">medium</div>
    <div class="font-bold text-boardroom">high</div>
    <div class="font-bold text-riskred">critical</div>
    <div class="font-bold text-boardroom">high</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-amber-100 p-2">team ×2</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-red-100 p-2 font-bold">technical</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-red-200 p-2 font-bold">dependency</div>
    <div class="font-bold text-boardroom">medium</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-slate-100 p-2">market</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-amber-100 p-2">execution</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-red-100 p-2">unknown</div>
    <div class="font-bold text-boardroom">low</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-slate-100 p-2">market</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-slate-100 p-2">execution</div>
    <div class="rounded bg-amber-100 p-2">technical</div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-charcoal/70">Live per-session matrix renders on the Scenarios page after you submit.</p>
</div>
<h2 class="mt-8 font-serif text-lg font-bold text-boardroom">How it works</h2>
<ol class="mt-2 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-6 text-sm text-charcoal">
  <li>Submit project name, description, type, launch date, team size, dependencies, known risks.</li>
  <li>Read 10 failure scenarios with precedents + warnings, plotted on the risk matrix.</li>
  <li>Select scenarios, plan mitigations, export the action plan CSV and share the markdown report.</li>
</ol>
<div class="mt-6">
  <Disclaimer />
</div>
</BaseLayout>
